Subject: [PATCH] em: the onboarding traces to em's debug channel

0237 to 0240 kept em_ctrl under its journal's cap (1000 lines per 30 s) through the rooms
and most of its starts, but not every start: lab-bringup restarts em_ctrl for each room
setup, every agent then onboards again, and em_ctrl logged each step of each radio's
em_config (WSC M1 and M2, the topology sync, AP capability, channel preference and
selection, the policy configuration and their acknowledgements), each data model node it
created and each command candidate it removed or cancelled (rdk-1004, 6 October 2026: 479
lines dropped in the window of one restart in four). Those traces now print through
em_util_dbg_print, as 0237 does (/nvram/emConfDbg, /nvram/emCtrlDbg); in the captured
restart they were 912 of 1386 lines. What remains on the journal is each AutoConfig Renew,
each Topology Response and WSC M1 received, validation failures and errors.

Upstream-Status: Pending

